## 2️⃣ Student Gamification System

### XP Points Formula

| Attendance Status | Timing | XP Earned |
|-------------------|--------|-----------|
| **Present (Early)** | Scanned 0–5 min after session start | **+100 XP** |
| **Present (On-Time)** | Scanned 5–cutoff min | **+75 XP** |
| **Late** | After cutoff | **+25 XP** |
| **Excused** | Manual override | **+40 XP** |
| **Absent** | Not scanned | **−20 XP** (floored at 0) |

> Early = `diffMinutes < 5`. Present = `5 ≤ diffMinutes ≤ cutoff`. Late = `diffMinutes > cutoff`.

### Streak System
- **Daily streak**: consecutive class sessions attended (present or late) without an unexcused absence
- Streak resets on `absent` status
- Streak badges unlocked at 3, 5, 10, 15, 20, 30 consecutive sessions

### Badges

| Badge | Trigger |
|-------|---------|
| 🔥 **First Scan** | First ever QR scan |
| ⚡ **Early Bird** | 5× early arrival (< 5 min) |
| 💎 **Perfect Week** | 3-session streak |
| 🏆 **5-Session Streak** | 5 consecutive present/late |
| 🌟 **10-Session Legend** | 10 consecutive sessions |
| 🚀 **Punctuality King** | 10× early attendance |
| 📚 **Semester Scholar** | ≥ 90% attendance rate all-time |

### DB Changes

```sql
-- New tables to add in db.js initDatabase()

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS student_xp (
  id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
  student_id TEXT REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  section_id TEXT REFERENCES sections(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  session_id TEXT REFERENCES class_sessions(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  attendance_record_id TEXT,
  xp_earned INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  reason TEXT,  -- 'early_present', 'on_time_present', 'late', 'excused', 'absent_deduction'
  created_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS student_badges (
  id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
  student_id TEXT REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  badge_key TEXT NOT NULL,  -- 'first_scan', 'early_bird', 'streak_3', etc.
  badge_name TEXT NOT NULL,
  badge_emoji TEXT,
  earned_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  UNIQUE(student_id, badge_key)
);

CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_xp_student ON student_xp(student_id);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_badges_student ON student_badges(student_id);
```

